-- Mean reversion, explained in 24 seconds. A 9:16 motion piece built only from godtongue elements on a desk.
create a video called mean-reversion, 1080 by 1920, on #d9d1c2, 24 s long.

-- 1 · title
make a paper called title from bond, 900 by 520, at 540 820.
write "MEAN REVERSION" called title-head in Bodoni Moda, at 450 235, size 92.
draw a line called title-rule from 300 285 to 600 285, 3 wide.
write "a quant strategy, explained" called title-sub in Jost, at 450 350, size 40.
write "QUANT NOTES · 01" called title-tag in Martian Mono, at 450 440, size 22.
enamel the title-head and the title-rule and the title-sub in #1d1b18.
enamel the title-tag in #c8361f.

-- 2 · the chart
make a paper called chart from bond, 960 by 860, at 540 820.
write "PRICE  vs  20-DAY MEAN" called chart-head in Martian Mono, at 480 90, size 26.
draw a line called grid-1 from 90 200 to 890 200, 2 wide.
draw a line called grid-2 from 90 320 to 890 320, 2 wide.
draw a line called grid-3 from 90 440 to 890 440, 2 wide.
draw a line called grid-4 from 90 560 to 890 560, 2 wide.
draw a line called grid-5 from 90 680 to 890 680, 2 wide.
draw a curve called upper from 90 316 through 164 310 through 239 305 through 313 301 through 388 298 through 462 296 through 537 296 through 611 298 through 685 301 through 760 306 through 834 311 to 890 315, 3 wide.
draw a curve called lower from 90 564 through 164 558 through 239 553 through 313 549 through 388 546 through 462 544 through 537 544 through 611 546 through 685 549 through 760 554 through 834 559 to 890 563, 3 wide.
dash the upper, 14 on 10 off.
dash the lower, 14 on 10 off.
draw a curve called mean from 90 440 through 164 434 through 239 429 through 313 425 through 388 422 through 462 420 through 537 420 through 611 422 through 685 425 through 760 430 through 834 435 to 890 439, 4 wide.
draw a curve called price from 90 356 through 109 384 through 127 424 through 146 428 through 164 446 through 183 452 through 202 441 through 220 444 through 239 419 through 257 441 through 276 431 through 295 472 through 313 454 through 332 458 through 350 434 through 369 444 through 388 440 through 406 444 through 425 441 through 443 439 through 462 418 through 481 413 through 499 394 through 518 330 through 537 293 through 555 315 through 574 322 through 592 354 through 611 391 through 630 433 through 648 461 through 667 443 through 685 450 through 704 482 through 723 535 through 741 563 through 760 573 through 778 557 through 797 536 through 816 516 through 834 469 through 853 436 through 871 479 to 890 425, 6 wide.
write "+2σ" called up-label in Martian Mono, at 925 302, size 24.
write "μ" called mean-label in Martian Mono, at 925 428, size 26.
write "−2σ" called lo-label in Martian Mono, at 925 562, size 24.
draw a circle called exit-ring, 26 big, at 630 433.
hollow the exit-ring, 5 wide.
write "EXIT" called exit-word in Martian Mono, at 630 390, size 24.
write "time →" called axis in Martian Mono, at 150 760, size 22.
enamel the grid-1 and the grid-2 and the grid-3 and the grid-4 and the grid-5 in #e3dccd.
enamel the upper and the lower and the up-label and the lo-label in #9b8f7e.
enamel the mean and the mean-label in #1d1b18.
enamel the price in #1f3b9b.
enamel the exit-ring and the exit-word in #2c7a3f.
enamel the chart-head and the axis in #5a5248.

-- 3 · the rule
make a card called formula from cardstock, 900 by 220, at 540 1380.
write "z = (price − mean) ÷ σ" called z-line in Martian Mono, at 450 100, size 46.
write "trade only when the stretch is extreme: |z| > 2" called z-rule in Jost, at 450 165, size 30.
enamel the z-line in #1d1b18.
enamel the z-rule in #c8361f.

-- 4 · stamps
make a sticker called sell-stamp from ink, 300 by 140, at 760 590, turned -9.
draw a rectangle called sell-box, 280 by 120, at 150 70, corners 14.
hollow the sell-box, 8 wide.
write "SELL" called sell-word in Big Shoulders Display, at 150 100, size 92.
enamel the sell-box and the sell-word in #c8361f.

make a sticker called buy-stamp from ink, 300 by 140, at 640 1100, turned 7.
draw a rectangle called buy-box, 280 by 120, at 150 70, corners 14.
hollow the buy-box, 8 wide.
write "BUY" called buy-word in Big Shoulders Display, at 150 100, size 92.
enamel the buy-box and the buy-word in #2c7a3f.

-- 5 · the catch
make a paper called catch from kraft, 900 by 900, at 540 860.
write "THE CATCH" called catch-head in Bodoni Moda, at 450 150, size 84.
draw a line called c-up from 90 380 to 810 380, 3 wide.
draw a line called c-mean from 90 500 to 810 500, 4 wide.
draw a line called c-lo from 90 620 to 810 620, 3 wide.
dash the c-up, 14 on 10 off.
dash the c-lo, 14 on 10 off.
draw a curve called breakout from 90 510 through 220 470 through 330 520 through 440 440 through 540 380 through 640 300 through 740 250 to 810 200, 6 wide.
write "a trend is a mean that moved" called catch-line in Jost, at 450 780, size 38.
enamel the c-up and the c-lo in #7a5f3e.
enamel the c-mean and the catch-head and the catch-line in #1d1b18.
enamel the breakout in #8f1d14.

make a sticker called stop-stamp from ink, 420 by 140, at 560 1330, turned -5.
draw a rectangle called stop-box, 400 by 120, at 210 70, corners 14.
hollow the stop-box, 8 wide.
write "STOP-LOSS" called stop-word in Big Shoulders Display, at 210 100, size 88.
enamel the stop-box and the stop-word in #c8361f.

-- 6 · end
make a card called end from cardstock, 900 by 620, at 540 880.
write "mean reversion" called end-head in Bodoni Moda, at 450 250, size 86.
write "z-score  ·  bands  ·  discipline" called end-sub in Jost, at 450 345, size 38.
write "QUANT NOTES · 01" called end-tag in Martian Mono, at 450 470, size 24.
enamel the end-head and the end-sub in #1d1b18.
enamel the end-tag in #c8361f.

-- motion
bring in the title at 0.2 s, from the bottom.
remove the title at 3.2 s, to the top.
bring in the chart at 3.4 s, from the right.
reveal the grid-1 and the grid-2 and the grid-3 and the grid-4 and the grid-5 at 3.9 s, over 0.5 s, fading.
reveal the mean and the mean-label at 4.3 s, over 1.4 s, from the left.
reveal the price at 4.8 s, over 2.6 s, from the left.
reveal the upper and the lower and the up-label and the lo-label at 7 s, over 0.8 s, fading.
bring in the formula at 7.6 s, from the bottom.
reveal the z-rule at 8.6 s, over 0.9 s, from the left.
glide the camera to 700 760, zoom 1.12, at 9.7 s, over 0.5 s.
slam the sell-stamp in at 10.1 s.
glide the camera to 680 1000, zoom 1.2, at 10.9 s, over 0.6 s.
slam the buy-stamp in at 11.6 s.
glide the camera to 540 960, zoom 1, at 12.6 s, over 0.6 s.
reveal the exit-ring and the exit-word at 13.3 s, over 0.4 s, fading.
remove the chart at 16.2 s, to the left.
remove the sell-stamp at 16.2 s, to the left.
remove the buy-stamp at 16.2 s, to the left.
remove the formula at 9.4 s, to the bottom.
bring in the catch at 16.5 s, from the right.
reveal the c-up and the c-mean and the c-lo at 17.1 s, over 0.5 s, fading.
reveal the breakout at 17.5 s, over 1.8 s, from the left.
reveal the catch-line at 19.4 s, over 0.8 s, from the left.
slam the stop-stamp in at 19.9 s.
remove the catch at 21.2 s, to the left.
remove the stop-stamp at 21.2 s, to the left.
bring in the end at 21.4 s, from the bottom.

-- captions
style the captions in Jost, size 62, #1d1b18, at 1640.
caption "Mean reversion: the bet that stretched prices snap back." at 0.4 s, for 2.8 s, "snap back" in #c8361f.
caption "Start with a rolling average of the price." at 3.8 s, for 3 s, "rolling average" in #c8361f.
caption "Then measure how far price strays, in standard deviations." at 7 s, for 2.6 s, "standard deviations" in #c8361f.
caption "Two sigma above the mean? Sell." at 9.9 s, for 1.6 s, "Sell" in #c8361f.
caption "Two sigma below? Buy." at 11.5 s, for 1.5 s, "Buy" in #2c7a3f.
caption "Close the trade when price is back at the mean." at 13.1 s, for 3 s, "back at the mean" in #2c7a3f.
caption "The catch: a trend can keep going. Size small, and cut losses." at 16.8 s, for 4.3 s, "cut losses" in #c8361f.
caption "Simple to state. Hard to trade well." at 21.7 s, for 2.2 s, "Hard" in #c8361f.
